### What the network library says when the meeting point cannot be reached or
### will not take something. English is exactly the library's own sentence.

failed-net-unreachable = could not reach the meeting point: { $why }
failed-net-broke-off = the meeting point's answer broke off: { $why }
failed-net-not-yet = the meeting point is not taking another statement from this {
    ""}address yet: { $said }
failed-net-full-for-today = the meeting point has taken all the statements it takes today: { $said }
failed-net-refused-because = the meeting point answered { $status }: { $said }
failed-net-refused = the meeting point answered { $status }
failed-net-statement-too-long = a statement of { $got } bytes is over the { $longest } the board holds
failed-net-not-an-address = the meeting point did not answer with an address
